<title>JAPAN: Aderans to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Aderans to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's leading hairpiece maker Aderans Co Ltd said on Thursday it plans to buy back up to two million common shares at a cost not exceeding five billion yen.</p>
<p>Aderans did not specify a time frame but said in a statement that the repurchase plan would be referred to a shareholders' meeting scheduled for May 22.</p>
<p>The firm also said it is planning to alter the minimum trading unit of its shares from 1,000 shares to 100 from July 1.</p>
